Package: rustiflow
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: iproute2
Description: Rust-based network flow analysis tool
 RustiFlow is a network flow analysis tool written in Rust. It supports
 real-time feature extraction and analysis from network interfaces or
 pcap files. It includes a TUI for configuration and monitoring.
 .
 Realtime capture uses eBPF tc classifiers. The rustiflow@<interface>
 systemd template unit runs it as a service configured from
 /etc/rustiflow/<interface>.toml.
